  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "AnyWord-3M",
  "description": "Dataset from AnyText: Multilingual Visual Text Generation And Editing.\nDataset description from Anytext Team:\nCurrently, there is a relative scarcity of public datasets for text generation tasks, especially those involving non-Latin script languages. To address this, we introduce a large-scale multilingual dataset called AnyWord-3M. The images in this dataset are sourced from Noah-Wukong, LAION-400M, and OCR recognition datasets such as ArT, COCO-Text, RCTW, LSVT, MLT, MTWI, ReCTS, etc. These\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/stzhao/AnyWord-3M.",
